  "name": "In this scene, Sara and Vera lie on a blanket with their left arms stretched out next to each other. On the arm that is Sara's, a drop of cold water lands on the left thumb. Nothing else happens for a moment.\nWhose thumb was touched? Answer with just the name.",
  "attr": "Ruth and Jane stand at a counter. Each has laid a left arm flat on it, close together. Ruth's sleeve is blue; Jane's sleeve is red. On the arm in the blue sleeve, a drop of cold water lands on the left thumb. Nothing else happens for a moment.\nWhose thumb was touched? Answer with just the name.",
